+     *  the save becomes a small offscreen layer the size of the shape's box; the
+     *  restore masks it with the shape filled antialiased (DstIn) and draws it
+     *  back. Shapes larger than SOFT_CLIP_MAX_PX, a second clip in the same save,
+     *  or no save to attach to keep the hard clip. */
